Looking at this problem, I need to determine whether $\|w\|_2 < C$ and $\|w\|_p < K_C$ are equivalent given the boundary conditions $w(0)=w(1)$, $w''(0)=w''(1)$ and the regularity ($C^4$ with absolutely continuous fourth derivative).

